      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hrm, yes there is probably a lot that could go wrong during _delete_project that would cause a bad state like that. I think the only way it could be fixed is if the foreign key relationship was reversed, and the foreign key from domain.id to user.domain_id had a cascading delete. I don\u0027t really want to try to change or insert more foreign keys here though, so I\u0027m not sure how to fix this.",
