      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah - I think the traditional way of solving this is to use FKs across all those entities in the backend... but we\u0027ve unfortunately moved against that because of the backend not always being SQL.\n\nMaybe we should brainstorm on how to deal with this, otherwise we\u0027ll just have to assume the risk :-/",
